# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Icetill Explorer permits its controller to play lands from their graveyard.
# Forcing: Island is the only playable land and exists only in the graveyard.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no meaningful decisions.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = scripted acceptance observes Island on the battlefield.
#   LOSE = Island remains in the graveyard at the one-turn deadline.
#   TIMEOUT = the play action or zone transfer stops advancing.
# Card roles:
#   Icetill Explorer — grants the alternate-zone land permission.
#   Island — land played through the ordinary play action.
#   Forest and Mountain — draw padding.
# Protocol path: land play action, user action, and graveyard-to-battlefield transfer.

